{
  "_comment": "Issue codes raised by scripts/crawl.py and their severity (error, warning, info). Length bounds are display conventions (titles and descriptions are truncated by pixel width, not by a fixed character count), so their codes are info only. Override per project with a crawl_rules object in config.json.",
